# Notepad PWA

A lightweight, privacy-first, offline-capable notepad built as a Progressive Web App.

Features:
- real-time autosave
- dark mode and focus mode
- installable PWA support
- timer and break reminders
- snapshots and note statistics
- ambient sound controls
- export as TXT, HTML, PDF, and DOCX
- floating window and fullscreen writing modes

## Local development

```bash
npm install
npm run dev
```

## Production build

```bash
npm run build
```

## Notes

This app stores notes in browser localStorage. Please download backups regularly via the export buttons or `Ctrl/Cmd + S`.

